{
  "bodyHash": "d5b95537cd549c04",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 根據採訪，幾位受訪者堅持表示他們親眼目睹了「屍體復活並攻擊他人」的場景，其中一人甚至聲稱自己看到「死鳥在天上飛」。前一天，疾病控制與預防中心（CDC）發言人堅稱所謂的「殭屍襲擊」純粹是胡說八道，只是看太多電影產生的幻覺，並繼續建議民眾待在室內，同時表示有效的藥物仍在臨床試驗階段。</span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 然而，仍有大量民眾陷入恐慌，開車逃離受感染的城市與州份，導致嚴重交通壅塞。截至本文撰寫時，總統已簽署行政命令，宣布全國進入軍事管制狀態。</span></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 史上最完整（開玩笑的）！生存者的裝備與物資清單！現在就開始學習如何抵禦殭屍大軍，並準備你自己的求生套件吧！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 本模組提供多種工具以於殭屍末日中生存，包含武器、防具、藥品等。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 此外，本模組也提供多種素材，讓整合包作者可以自訂物品的合成配方，使整合包更具現代感，同時無需引入複雜的科技模組。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eJEYhZooBik\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/772/86/2023-12-05_10.png\" width=\"1857\" height=\"984\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">警告：從 1.6 版本開始，本模組需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a> 作為依賴項；從 2.0 測試版開始，則需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sona-survival-101\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sona Survival 101</a> 作為依賴項。此更新變更了部分物品的 ID，因此請在更新前備份你的世界存檔！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f90\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillagers-gun\" rel=\"nofollow\">掠奪者之槍</a>，掠奪者將使用槍械與怪物作戰！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f90\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guard-villagers\" rel=\"nofollow\">守衛村民</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/recruits\" rel=\"nofollow\">村民新兵</a> 也將使用機槍！</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">本模組目前已兼容 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli（百科全書）</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat（更佳戰鬥）</a>！</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/730/25/patchouli.png\" alt=\"Patchouli book\" width=\"1094\" height=\"729\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>建議</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 由於本模組的武器與防具具有較高的傷害與護甲值，用以平衡槍械模組，因此建議搭配其他改善生物行為的模組（如 Consecration、EnhancedAI 與 Mobs Properties Randomness）一起使用，效果最佳。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>狀態效果</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">1. 困惑</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">使生物無法鎖定目標。若玩家處於此減益狀態，會產生噁心效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">2. 脆弱</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">降低護甲值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">3. 免疫</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">幫助你控制感染，並對不死生物及模組內帶有「undead_mob」標籤的生物（可透過資料包自訂）在近戰攻擊玩家時施加多種減益效果。但高等級的免疫會 <strong>直接殺死玩家</strong>。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">4. 止痛</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">免疫虚弱、<strong>挖掘疲勞</strong>與緩慢效果。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">5. 偽裝</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">隱藏自身。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">6. 暴露</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">已被敵人發現。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">7. 暈眩</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">哎呀，這很痛。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>武器與工具</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">1. 撬棍</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">造成緩慢效果。右鍵點擊可撬開門與箱子。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">2. 棒球棍</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">具有掃擊效果，可擊退生物。但傷害與耐久度較低。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">3. 砍刀</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">具有掃擊效果，如同劍一般。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">4. 消防斧</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">造成極高傷害與脆弱效果，但攻擊速度非常低。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">5. 匕首</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">傷害低但攻擊速度極快。右鍵點擊可對未攻擊你的敵人造成巨大傷害。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">6. 耙子</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">攻擊範圍更長。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">7. 扳手</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">可投擲，蓄力後可暈眩敵人。副手時可用來操作裝置。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">8. 黏液罐</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">對所有生物造成困惑效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">9. 藥水瓶</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">對不死生物及模組內帶有「undead_mob」標籤的生物造成脆弱、緩慢與虚弱效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">10. 莫洛托夫特調</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">燃燒一切。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>防具</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">1. 滑雪服</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">穿戴整套可提升移動速度，護目鏡可免疫失明效果，靴子可讓你在粉雪上行走。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">2. 標準/防暴戰術服</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">外觀帥氣，在特定生態域中可隱蔽玩家行蹤。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">3. 拆彈服</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">以犧牲攻擊力與移動速度換取更高護甲。穿戴整套可提供生命恢復與抗性提升。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">4. EXO 外骨骼裝甲</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">極度酷炫，裝甲的每一部分都會為你提供增益效果。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>醫療用品</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">1. 繃帶</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">治療自身。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">2. 止痛藥</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">提供吸收效果與止痛狀態。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">3. 急救包</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">專業醫療工具，可用於治療與止痛。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">4. 奇蹟藥物</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">治癒感染，並為玩家提供多種增益效果，同時增加一級免疫等級。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">5. 可疑藥物</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">喔！這看起來很噁心。但或許它能治癒感染？</span></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>感染系統</strong></span></h3>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">現在，受到不死生物的近戰攻擊或食用受感染的食物都會讓你感染。受到的傷害越多，病情就越嚴重！請好好照顧自己！你的盔甲也能提供保護！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">盔甲能減少感染機率，而盔甲堅固度（Armor Toughness）則能幫助你抵抗感染！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以使用<strong> /infection</strong> 指令來設定/查詢玩家的感染等級。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">0 - 40 無特殊效果</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">40 - 70 飢餓</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">70 - 90 緩弱、緩速、飢餓</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">90 - 99 緩弱II、緩速、飢餓、失明</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">100 死亡</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>此外，感染等級會逐漸上升。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">和平模式：每 1600 刻（80 秒）減少 1</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">簡單模式：低於 40 時，每 1600 刻減少 1</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">普通模式：低於 40 時每 1600 刻減少 1，高於 70 時每 1600 刻增加 1</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">困難模式：高於 40 時，每 1600 刻增加 1</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>你也可以使用資料包（Datapack）來設定治療感染的物品。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">擁有標籤「infection_decrease」的物品會降低 15 點感染等級。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">擁有標籤「infection_clear」的物品會完全治癒玩家。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">擁有標籤&nbsp;「undead_mob」的生物在近戰攻擊時會造成感染。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">擁有標籤「infected_food」的食物會造成 10 點感染等級。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>你可以使用遊戲規則（gamerule）`disableInfection` 來關閉感染系統。</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>出血系統</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">現在受到傷害不僅會扣除生命值，還會造成傷口導致玩家流血。受到的傷害越高，傷口就越嚴重。小傷口會隨時間慢慢癒合，但過於嚴重的傷口若不及時處理會惡化。失血會使玩家逐漸虛弱，甚至吸引殭屍。因此，必須及時使用醫療用品處理傷口。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">遊戲內 HUD 顯示數值為 100 減去流血值。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">0 - 20 身體健康。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">20 - 40&nbsp;脆弱。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">40 - 60 脆弱II、緩弱、暴露與緩速。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">60 - 80&nbsp;脆弱IV、緩弱II、暴露與緩速。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">80 - 99&nbsp;脆弱VI、緩弱II、暴露與緩速II。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">100 死亡。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">若你的傷口已包紮，便不會吸引殭屍。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以使用遊戲規則（gamerule）`disablebleed` 來關閉流血系統。</span></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">其他</span></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">現在襲擊者會與怪物一同出沒攻擊！</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>未來規劃：</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">更多藥物（已完成）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">陷阱（已完成）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">弩</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">EXO 裝備充電功能、更多 EXO 裝備技能</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">更多迷彩樣式（已完成）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">電鋸</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">感染系統（已完成）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Patchouli 百科書（已完成）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">任何絕佳點子</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>貢獻者</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Konn_gara</strong> - 程式開發</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Kyoko</strong> - 美術設計</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>阿琦</strong> - 美術設計</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>白久谷</strong> - 模型製作</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>IronCurtain</strong> - 模型製作</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>lan2418</strong> - 翻譯</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>轩影LHXQing</strong> - 結構設計</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>Scarasol</strong>&nbsp;-&nbsp;吉祥物設計</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>我的 Minecraft 伺服器全體成員</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>常見問題（Q&A）</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>1. 會有 Fabric 或其他版本嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 抱歉，由於我正在同時開發三款模組，目前沒有精力移植到其他版本。不過，歡迎其他開發者進行移植。<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>2. 可以放入整合包（Modpack）嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 你可以在非營利性伺服器與整合包中使用本模組。若用於商業用途，則需事先取得我的許可。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>3. 可以重新上傳嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 不行。</span></p>",
